messages.et:
{07 00 00}Tere, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 1f 00}.{01 00 00 05 00} {07 0b 00}Kas sa
tahaksid midagi näha? {01 00 00 0a 00}
Muidugi tahad.
{07 16 00}See ülimalt imelik kiri{01 00 00 05 00}
ilmus ühel päeval lihtsalt
mu postkasti.

messages.en:
{07 1b 00}Terrible writing, isn't it?{01 00 00 14 00}
{07 15 00}I had the worst time trying
to decode it!
{07 19 00}Why would someone send
something like this?{01 00 00 0a 00} It's
just embarrassing.{07 00 00}

messages.et:
{07 1b 00}Kohutav kirjutis, kas pole?{01 00 00 14 00}
{07 15 00}Mul oli kõige raskem üritada
seda lahti muukida!
{07 19 00}Miks keegi saadaks
midagi sellist?{01 00 00 0a 00} See on
lihtsalt piinlik.{07 00 00}

messages.en:
{07 14 00}Nice handwriting, wouldn't
you say?{01 01 00} {07 19 00}Yep, that one's a
good friend of mine!{07 00 00}

messages.et:
{07 14 00}Kena käekiri, kas sa ei
ütleks?{01 01 00} {07 19 00}Jah, see on üks
mu hea sõber!{07 00 00}
